🌐 Deployment Options
📦 Option A: GitHub Pages (FREE - Recommended)
Step 1: Create GitHub Repository

bash
1. Go to https://github.com/new
2. Repository name: sakthi-portfolio
3. Set to Public (required for free hosting)
4. Click "Create repository"
Step 2: Upload Files

bash
# Using Git commands
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/sakthi-portfolio.git
cd sakthi-portfolio
cp /path/to/sakthi-portfolio.html ./index.html
git add index.html
git commit -m "Add portfolio website"
git push origin main

# OR: Drag and drop via GitHub website
1. In your repository, click "Add file" → "Upload files"
2. Drag sakthi-portfolio.html
3. Rename to index.html
4. Click "Commit changes"
Step 3: Enable GitHub Pages

bash
1. Go to repository → Settings
2. Scroll to "GitHub Pages" section
3. Under "Branch", select "main" / "master"
4. Click Save
5. Wait 1-2 minutes
6. Your site is live at: https://YOUR_USERNAME.github.io/sakthi-portfolio/
📦 Option B: Netlify (FREE - Most Professional)
Step 1: Create Netlify Account

bash
1. Go to https://www.netlify.com
