🚨 Common Issues & Solutions
Issue	Solution
Blank white page	Check file is named index.html, not .html.txt
Links not working	Ensure anchor links use #section-id format
Contact form not sending	Add Formspree/EmailJS backend (frontend-only works locally)
GitHub Pages 404	Wait 5 mins, check branch is set to main
Netlify deploy fails	Ensure file is named index.html
Custom domain not working	Wait 24-48 hours for DNS propagation
